# ***What's New in Slate***

### ***Email, Built Into Your Workflows***

Slate now makes it easier to keep in touch with everyone tied to your workflows, internal or external.

You can now reply all and see every party included on an email thread, all without leaving Slate. No more bouncing between your inbox and Slate to send or look up emails. Every thread is saved to the project it belongs to, so you have a clear history of communication tied directly to your workflows and registrations.

That means less staff time spent tracking down messages, stronger due diligence, and better support for your compliance efforts.

### ***Switch to BuildingBlocks in One Click***

A new app switcher in Slate takes you straight to your BuildingBlocks instance, so moving between workflows and data takes one click.

This shortcut came directly from customer feedback, so keep it coming. [Send us your feedback](mailto:support@tolemi.com) and help shape what we build next.
